---
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about__header" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Who I Am</h2>
      <div class="section-rule"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="about__grid">
      <div class="about__text" data-reveal data-delay="1">
        <p>
          I'm a <strong>Senior Software Engineer</strong> with <strong>4+ years</strong> of experience
          designing and shipping backend systems at enterprise scale. I specialize in
          distributed microservices, high-throughput data pipelines, and cloud-native
          infrastructure — solving the kind of problems where reliability, performance,
          and cost all matter at the same time.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work has spanned systems processing tens of millions of events per day,
          infrastructure serving multi-cloud environments across AWS, GCP, and Azure,
          and optimizations that have driven meaningful reductions in compute costs
          and query volume at scale.
        </p>
        <p>
          I care deeply about code quality — 85%+ test coverage, observable systems,
          and engineering practices that hold up under pressure. I've also invested
          in the people around me through mentorship, code reviews, and raising
          the bar for entire teams.
        </p>

        <div class="about__actions">
          <!-- Replace /resume.pdf with your actual hosted resume URL -->
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn--primary" download aria-label="Download resume PDF">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-4"/>
              <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/>
              <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/>
            </svg>
            Download Resume
          </a>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline">Get in Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about__aside" data-reveal data-delay="2">
        <div class="edu-card card">
          <div class="edu-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/>
              <path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="edu-card__body">
            <p class="edu-card__inst">RGUKT IIIT Ongole</p>
            <p class="edu-card__degree">Bachelor of Technology (B.Tech)</p>
            <div class="edu-card__meta">
              <span>Jun 2018 – Apr 2022</span>
              <span class="edu-card__cgpa">CGPA 8.1</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-facts">
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
            <span>High-throughput data pipelines</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">☁️</span>
            <span>Multi-cloud — AWS, GCP, Azure</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">🔧</span>
            <span>Java · Go · Spring Boot · Kafka</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">🚀</span>
            <span>Kubernetes · Helm · ArgoCD</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">🧪</span>
            <span>85%+ test coverage, production-proven</span>
          </div>
          <div class="quick-fact">
            <span class="quick-fact__icon" aria-hidden="true">👥</span>
            <span>Mentorship & engineering leadership</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--bg); }

  .about__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about__text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.2rem;
  }
  .about__text p { color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.8; }
  .about__text strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

  .about__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Education card */
  .edu-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .edu-card__icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    background: rgba(99,102,241,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.2);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--indigo-lt);
  }

  .edu-card__body { flex: 1; }
  .edu-card__inst { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .edu-card__degree { font-size: 0.87rem; color: var(--text-2); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .edu-card__meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }
  .edu-card__cgpa { color: var(--indigo-lt); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Quick facts */
  .quick-facts {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .quick-fact {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    transition: border-color 0.2s var(--ease), transform 0.2s var(--ease);
  }
  .quick-fact:hover {
    border-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.3);
    transform: translateX(4px);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .quick-fact__icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>
